Returns <a href="../org/springframework/cache/annotation/ProxyCachingConfiguration.html" title="class in org.springframework.cache.annotation"><code>ProxyCachingConfiguration</code></a> or <code>AspectJCachingConfiguration</code>
for <code>PROXY</code> and <code>ASPECTJ</code> values of <a href="../org/springframework/cache/annotation/EnableCaching.html#mode()"><code>EnableCaching.mode()</code></a>,
respectively.

Returns <a href="../org/springframework/scheduling/annotation/ProxyAsyncConfiguration.html" title="class in org.springframework.scheduling.annotation"><code>ProxyAsyncConfiguration</code></a> or <code>AspectJAsyncConfiguration</code>
for <code>PROXY</code> and <code>ASPECTJ</code> values of <a href="../org/springframework/scheduling/annotation/EnableAsync.html#mode()"><code>EnableAsync.mode()</code></a>,
respectively.

Setting an <a href="../org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html" title="interface in org.springframework.context"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> is optional: If set, registered
tasks will be activated in the <a href="../org/springframework/context/event/ContextRefreshedEvent.html" title="class in org.springframework.context.event"><code>ContextRefreshedEvent</code></a> phase;
if not set, it will happen at <a href="../org/springframework/scheduling/annotation/ScheduledAnnotationBeanPostProcessor.html#afterSingletonsInstantiated()"><code>ScheduledAnnotationBeanPostProcessor.afterSingletonsInstantiated()</code></a> time.
